		'"Oh yes <<$pcs_nickname>>, I don''t remember ever having gone there before so thank you for taking me. Let me just go and tell my <<$npc_nickname[''A29'']>> as I''ve worked hard and saved up enough so we can stay over and get breakfast."'
		'You are a little concerned and look at her quizzically, "Are you sure Natasha, that''s 500 rubles just for a standard room?"'
		'Natasha replies, "Well I wanted to do a little something nice for you so, as I said I''ve worked hard and saved up enough for a room and some breakfast plus there should be some left over for something to eat while we are there. I want to make this a special trip for us and spend the night with you without <<$npc_nickname[''A29'']>> walking in." You both giggle remembering the embarrassing event when Bella entered while you were making out.'

		act 'Bella''s present':
			*clr & cla
			'<center><img <<$set_imgh>> src="images/characters/pavlovsk/school/girl/natasha/events/bullied/natasha9.jpg"></center>'
			'Five minutes later Natasha returns smiling. "Okay <<$pcs_nickname>>, let''s go. I''ve let <<$npc_nickname[''A29'']>> know and she''s happy for us and has also given me a little bit more money so now we can definately have something to eat tonight as well."'
			'"Well that was very generous of her, especially that I know how difficult things are for her."'
			'"I know <<$pcs_nickname>> and don''t worry I gave her a big thank you for it. Do you need to let your parents know you won''t be back tonight?"'
			'You shake your head, "No Natasha, it''ll be okay and I still need to work out how to tell <<$npc_nickname[''A29'']>> about us anyway... I''m really not looking forward to that conversation with her as I know she''ll probably be mad; I just hope she doesn''t go too far overboard as I''ve pretty much had it with her domineering attitude and don''t want to say something and make it even worse!"'
			'She looks at you with concern as you both stand and give each other a hug then head off to the station.'

			act 'Train journey':
				*clr & cla
				'<center><img <<$set_imgh>> src="images/locations/city/citycenter/hotel/receptionist.jpg"></center>'
				'On arriving at the station you buy two tickets to St. Petersburg centre and hand over the 300 rumbles at the ticket office.'
				'After an uneventful journey you arrive at St Petersburg Centre and head off to the Hotel Indigo to check in.'

				!If Sveta doesn''t race and/or do kickboxing at the gym in St. P. (so either only works in Pav or St.P.)
				if runnerQW['joined_team'] <= 0 and kickbox['amateurWin'] + kickbox['amateurLoss'] + kickbox['amateurDraw'] <= 0:
					act 'Go to your hotel room':
						*clr & cla
						minut += 10
						gs 'stat'

						'<center><img <<$set_imgh>> src="images/locations/pavlovsk/hotel/hotel.room.normal.jpg"></center>'
						'You both approach the receptionist and Natasha rents a standard room for one night and pays for it giving you a big smile.'
						'After paying for the room you head up there and check it out.'
						'You turn to Natasha. "Thank you for this Natasha, it''s very kind of you and absolutely wasn''t expected."'
						'Natasha gives you a hug. "I just want to show my appreciation for all you''ve done for me. I''ve so enjoyed being with you and was overjoyed when you called me your girlfriend. That was so unexpected, especially after my... Erm... Stupidity with... Lazar" Natasha stops talking and blushes.'
						'You return her hug. "Well don''t worry about it Natasha; that was before our time together anyway. I didn''t really expect our relationship to go like this either. Initially I just thought you were nice and we could be friends and do our homework together. We''re both still very young and so let''s enjoy our journey together and see where it goes."'
						'Natasha nods her agreement as you continue. "Anyway Natasha are you all set?"'
						'Natasha nods at you "Yes <<$pcs_nickname>> shall we go and explore for a while?"'
						'"Yep, sounds like a plan, let''s go."'

						act 'Go and explore the city':
							*clr & cla
							minut += 60
							gs 'stat'

							'<center><img <<$set_imgh>> src="images/locations/city/citycentre/down.jpg"></center>'
							'You both leave the hotel, link arms and wander off slowly taking in the sights of the city centre and just spend some time chatting together as you go.'
							'There are some wonderful places to take in including the Cathedral of Our Lady of Kazan and you both just enjoy the sights and sounds of the city until you spot the main library, which you know will be of great interest to Natasha so you steer her in that direction.'

							act 'Go to the library':
								*clr & cla
								minut += 20
								gs 'stat'

								'<center><img <<$set_imgh>> src="images/locations/city/citycentre/library/downlibint.jpg"></center>'
								'"Come on Natasha, that looks like the National Library, it''s supposed to be huge and I''m sure you''ll find it useful when you go to university, let''s take a look."'
								'Natasha looks at you and asks, "So <<$pcs_nickname>> aren''t you going to go to university then? Only I thought we might both need to come here for research?"'
								'You smile at her, "I''ve got some time before I need to decide, after all we''re not all as clever as you."'
								'She gives your arm a squeeze. "You know I''ll help you with your studies so if you want to go I''m sure it won''t be a problem. Anyway, as you say, I guess we''ll have to wait and see. After all nothing is to be taken for granted."'
								'You smile back at her but don''t reply as you enter the very impressive library and spend some time looking through the various sections before you exit shortly followed by Natasha.'
								'"I could spend all day in there <<$pcs_nickname>>, there''s so many interesting books and such a wonderful building too."'
								'"Yep, well as impressive as it is I didn''t want to spend all our time in there. There''s plenty of time for that. Come on let''s go to the park and take a stroll."'

								act 'Go to the park and have a walk':
									*clr & cla
									minut += 130
									gs 'stat'

									'<center><img <<$set_imgh>> src="images/locations/city/centralpark/park.jpg"></center>'
									'You both link arms and head off to the central park. After just over half an hour you arrive and take a stroll around the park taking care to avoid a group of junkies and pass by a cafe.'
									'"That looks like a nice place, how about we finish our walk then maybe freshen up. We coulsd maybe head over here later."'
									'Natasha looks a bit unsure. "Well yes <<$pcs_nickname>> maybe but I guess that the park might not be very safe after dark."'
									'You shake your head "Come on Natasha, there are two of us and if we go straight here and when we leave head directly back to the hotel we should be safe enough. Where''s your sense of adventure?"'
									'"Well okay then <<$pcs_nickname>> let''s do that. We''ll just need to make sure we keep our wits about us."'
									'You give her a friendly smile then with the evening plan decided you head back to the hotel and freshen up before a bit.'
									!This path now rejoins at ''Go to mall'' below:
									act 'Go to the mall': gt 'natbel_friend', 'city_date1_mall'
								end
							end
						end
					end
				else
					!If Sveta races and/or does kickboxing at the gym in St. P.
					act 'Go to your hotel room':
						*clr & cla
						minut += 10
						gs 'stat'

						'<center><img <<$set_imgh>> src="images/locations/pavlovsk/hotel/hotel.room.normal.jpg"></center>'
						'On arriving and going to the reception desk to check in Natasha tells you to put your money away and pays for the room.'
						'After paying for the room you head up there and check it out.'
						'You turn to her. "Thank you for this Natasha, it''s very kind of you and absolutely wasn''t expected."'
						'She gives you a hug. "I just want to show my appreciation for all you''ve done for me. I''ve so enjoyed being with you and was overjoyed when you called me your girlfriend. That was so unexpected, as well as... Erm..." Natasha stops talking and blushes.'
						'You return her hug. "Well don''t worry Natasha. I didn''t really expect our relationship to go like this either. Initially I just thought you were nice and we could be friends and do our homework together. We''re both still very young and we''ll need to enjoy our journey together and see where it leads."'
						'Natasha nods her agreement.'

						act 'Tell Natasha you''ll see her after the gym':
							*clr & cla
							minut += 10
							gs 'stat'

							'<center><img <<$set_imgh>> src="images/locations/city/citycenter/gym/desk.jpg"></center>'

							!If Sveta races and/or does kickboxing as well add in the below
							if kickbox['amateurWin'] + kickbox['amateurLoss'] + kickbox['amateurDraw'] > 0:
								'"Anyway I need to be heading off to the gym as I compete there in a kickboxing competition. You can have a little while to yourself and I''ll text you when I''m done."'
								'Natasha is stunned. "Oh <<$pcs_nickname>>! What? You might get badly hurt!"'
								'"Now that''s the reason I didn''t get you a ticket to watch it!" You say smiling at her and you give her a reassuring smile. "Anyway, I haven''t got too badly hurt yet plus I get paid prize money if I win."'
								'Natasha still looks worried and shakes her head but doesn''t say anything.'
								'You continue, "I''ll drop you a text when I go for my shower so you can meet me in the gym''s reception area then we can go for a bite to eat."'
								'A still worried looking Natasha gives you a hug. "Okay <<$pcs_nickname>>, good luck and please try to be careful in the fight."'
								'You hug her back and kiss her on the cheek before heading off to get ready.'
								!!If Sveta beat Christina in the fight add the following lines with a break in the text
								if christinaQW['fight'] = 1:
									'As you release her from her hug you tell her, "Look Natasha, don''t worry too much about the kickboxing fight; how do you think I was able to beat Christina? That''s one of the reasons I started training for it then as I got better and started doing well in sparring matches it was the obvious choice to progress to the weekly fights."'
									'Natasha returns your kiss, "Well I can''t complain about you stopping that bully. Just be careful <<$pcs_nickname>>."'
									'"Will do Natasha, see you soon." You head off to get ready.'
									'You have a quick think and decide if you want to get a take-away from the diner or just enter the gym. Knowing that Natasha is waiting for you, you decide that you won''t do any training today and just take part in the fight then head to the track for the race and meet her after having a shower.'
								end
							!If Sveta races
							else
								'"Anyway I need to be heading off to the gym for my race. I''ve got you a ticket so you can watch if you want or you can have a while to yourself and I''ll text you when I''m done."'
								'"Oh no <<$pcs_nickname>> I wouldn''t miss your race for the world! Let''s go."'
								'You both head off to the Havana Fitness Centre where you give Natasha her ticket and you tell her that you''ll see her later and meet her in the gym''s reception area, after the race has finished.'
								'You have a quick think and decide if you want to get a take-away from the diner or just enter the gym. Knowing that Natasha is waiting for you, you decide that you won''t do any training today and just take part in the race then shower and meet her after.'
							end

							temp_gold_medals = runnerQW['gold_medals']
							act 'Continue': gt 'natbel_friend', 'city_date1_sporthub'
						end
					end
				end
			end
		end
	end
end

if $ARGS[0] = 'city_date1_sporthub':
	menu_off = 1
	gs 'shortgs', 'setloc', 'natbel_friend', 'city_date1_sporthub'

	'<center><b><font color="maroon">Dressing</font></b></center>'
	'<center><img <<$set_imgh>> src="images/locations/city/citycenter/gym/locker.jpg"></center>'
	'Recruiting girls for local track team, the winners will receive cash prizes.'
	'Attention, visitors to the sports section must wear sports outfits and shoes when using the facilities.'

	if pcs_sweat >= 20:
		act 'Take a shower (0:15)':
			*clr & cla
			menu_off = 1
			minut += 15
			pcs_horny += 1
			pcs_hairbsh = 0
			pcs_makeup = 1
			if pcs_inhib < 15: inhib_exp += rand(1,2)
			dynamic $showerdin
			'<center><video autoplay loop src="images/shared/home/bathroom/dush.mp4"></video></center>'
			'You go into the bathroom and turn on the shower. You lather your body and wash in the shower.'
			if deodorant_on = 1: gs 'sweat', 'remove_deo' & '<br>Your deodorant gets washed away in the shower.'

			act 'Get out of the shower': gt $loc, $loc_arg
		end
	end

	act 'Use mirror': gt 'mirror', 'start'
	act 'Change outfit': gt 'wardrobe', 'start'

	if pcs_stam < stammax / 5 or pcs_energy < 20:
		act 'Take a short rest and get some food from a nearby diner':
			cla
			if pcs_stam < stammax / 5: pcs_stam += stammax / 3
			if pcs_energy < 20: pcs_energy += 50
			*nl
			'You quickly run outside, grab a bite to eat and a bit of fresh air. You already feel much better.'
			act 'Continue': gt 'natbel_friend', 'city_date1_sporthub'
		end
	end

	if kickbox['amateurWin'] + kickbox['amateurLoss'] + kickbox['amateurDraw'] > 0 and kickbox['amateur_fight_day'] ! daystart:
		if pcs_stam < stammax / 5:
			act 'Enter the amateur fight': '<br><font color="red">You are to exhausted to do this. Recover your stamina.</font>'
		elseif pcs_energy < 20:
			act 'Enter the amateur fight': '<br><font color="red">You feel too hungry to do this.</font>'
		elseif $clothingworntype ! 'danilovich_outfits' or $shoeworntype ! 'danilovich':
			act 'Enter the amateur fight': '<br><font color="red">You need to wear your sport clothes.</font>'
		else
			act 'Enter the amateur fight':
				kickbox['amateur_fight_day'] = daystart
				pcs_mood += 2
				gs 'exercise', 'tier3', 30, 'jab', 'punch', 'kick', 'def'
				gs 'kickboxing_funcs', 'init_fight_vars'

				kickbox['opponent'] = kickbox['sash'] + (rand(-2, 5) / 2)
				temp_kickboxVars['fight_type'] = 1

				gs 'kickboxing_funcs', 'generate_opponent', 'amateur_fight', kickbox['opponent']
				gt 'havana_kickboxing', 'match'
			end
		end
	elseif pcs_run >= 20 and runnerQW['comp_day'] ! daystart and runnerQW['joined_team'] > 0:
		if pcs_stam < stammax / 5:
			act '<b>Enter competition race</b>': '<br><font color="red">You are to exhausted to do this. Recover your stamina before entering the race.</font>'
		elseif pcs_energy < 20:
			act '<b>Enter competition race</b>': '<br><font color="red">You feel too hungry to do this.</font>'
		elseif $clothingworntype ! 'danilovich_outfits' or $shoeworntype ! 'danilovich':
			act '<b>Enter competition race</b>': '<br><font color="red">You need to wear your sport clothes.</font>'
		else
			act '<b>Enter competition race</b>':
				$loc_arg = 'city_date1_aftersport'
				gt 'havana_running', 'race_start'
			end
		end
	else
		if $clothingworntype = 'danilovich_outfits' or $shoeworntype = 'danilovich':
			act 'Go to the mall with Natasha': '<br><font color="red">You need to wear your normal clothes.</font>'
		else
			act 'Go to the mall with Natasha': gt 'natbel_friend', 'city_date1_mall'
		end
	end

	if mc_inventory['deodorant'] > 0 and deodorant_on = 0:
		'Your deodorant will last you for <b><<mc_inventory[''deodorant'']>></b> more '+iif(mc_inventory['deodorant'] =  1, 'application.', 'applications.')
		act 'Apply deodorant (0:01)':
			*clr & cla
			menu_off = 1
			minut += 1
			mc_inventory['deodorant'] -=  1
			gs 'sweat', 'deo'
			iif(func('body_din','pregnancyVisibility') = 1, '<center><img <<$set_imgh>> src="images/shared/home/bathroom/deodorant_preg.jpg"></center>', '<center><img <<$set_imgh>> src="images/shared/home/bathroom/deodorant.jpg"></center>')
			'You apply deodorant to your armpits. It will keep you feeling fresh and clean for longer.'
			act 'Continue': menu_off = 0 & gt $loc, $loc_arg
		end
	end
	dynamic $tampon
end



